(
    description: "32-bit microcontroller (Cortex-M3, 72 MHz, 64 KB flash, 20 KB RAM) in an LQFP-48: a USB full-speed device with its D+ pull-up built in, an 8 MHz crystal oscillator, SWD debug and 30 GPIO. On the sheet it draws its run current from VDD",
